sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant E as Express
    participant C as CORS and body parsers
    participant L as languageMiddleware
    participant A as authMiddleware
    participant R as Router
    participant H as Controller
    participant V as Validator
    participant S as Application service
    participant P as Repository port
    participant D as MariaDB

    B->>E: HTTP request + Bearer JWT + lang
    E->>C: cors(), json(), urlencoded()
    C->>L: resolve language
    L->>L: set shared language and build req.t
    L->>A: next()
    A->>A: jwt.verify(token, SECRET_KEY)
    A-->>R: req.usuarioId, req.rol
    R->>H: action
    H->>V: validate payload
    V-->>H: ok or ValidationError
    H->>S: use case
    S->>P: repository calls
    P->>D: SQL
    D-->>P: rows
    P-->>S: entity or row object
    S-->>H: result
    H-->>E: ok(req, res, payload)
    E-->>B: JSON

    Note over A,D: No transaction is opened here.<br/>Multi-step use cases run as independent autocommit statements.
